      "name": "Strategy Pod (Growth Pod) — $9,000/month strategy plus execution | Quantocos",
      "description": "The Strategy Pod, also called the Growth Pod, is a $9,000/month subscription team of one manager, six specialists and six AI agents covering strategy, creative and digital marketing together. 360 credits/month, no add-on fees.",
